{"data":{"id":"zpHeXAqTZMA","slug":"jeremih","title":"Jeremih","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"BEmvDgKpC5c","slug":"late-nights-jeftuz-remix","title":"Late Nights (Jeftuz Remix)"},{"id":"gISMbfMNby0","slug":"the-end-ft-chance-the-rapper","title":"The End ft. Chance the Rapper"},{"id":"5zRdCHjFVP4","slug":"what-i-like-jeftuz-remix","title":"What I Like (Jeftuz Remix)"},{"id":"kcwFPNDVqvQ","slug":"worthy-ft-jhene-aiko","title":"Worthy ft. Jhené Aiko"},{"id":"W5KNWK9V7EA","slug":"worthy-feat-jhene-aiko","title":"Worthy (feat. Jhene Aiko)"},{"id":"8AuZY2rztck","slug":"i-did-feat-feather","title":"I Did (feat. Feather)"},{"id":"_95DxIukvmQ","slug":"i-think-of-you-feat-chris-brown-and-big-sean","title":"I Think of You (feat. Chris Brown & Big Sean)"},{"id":"m5dnXqoE0aY","slug":"czech-republic","title":"Czech Republic"},{"id":"8I-EZD89Zcc","slug":"woosah-feat-juicy-j-and-twista","title":"Woosah (feat. Juicy J & Twista)"},{"id":"4b-10Uehuro","slug":"chillin-jaw-jam-bootleg","title":"Chillin (Jaw Jam Bootleg)"},{"id":"-xOpYdwWVI0","slug":"773-love-cashmere-cat-edit","title":"773 Love (Cashmere Cat Edit)"}]},"markers":[{"id":"8exqaps0NOM","position":2,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jeremih - Late Nights (Jeftuz Remix)","track":{"id":"BEmvDgKpC5c","path":"/artists/jeremih/tracks/late-nights-jeftuz-remix/","slug":"late-nights-jeftuz-remix","title":"Late Nights (Jeftuz Remix)","artist":{"slug":"jeremih","title":"Jeremih"},"artwork":"images/artists/jeremih/tracks/late-nights-jeftuz-remix.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"mT0b7zueZhI","slug":"138","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-138-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #138 w/ Great Dane","artwork":"/images/episodes/138.jpg","content":"\nProducer Great Dane (co-founder of Team Supreme) delivers energy and bass\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nFor this show we had the young and progressive producer Great Dane who is the co-founder of one of the best collectives in LA (Team Supreme) and an artist on Alpha Pup. Joe Kay kicked things off for the first hour & 28 minutes of exclusive material ranging from Mr. Carmack, Kaytranada, Sango, Jo Def, Esta, and many others. Great Dane truly understands our memo when we say, 'NO TIME FOR FILLER TRACKS'. As soon as he hit play constant energy and bass started flowing. He played an exclusive 45 minute set which consisted of all original productions except for two tracks. This won't be the last time you hear from him.\n \n\n\n\n Thanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10810,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-07-27T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"QQV0wUIKuVE","position":1,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jeremih - Late Nights (Jeftuz Remix)","track":{"id":"BEmvDgKpC5c","path":"/artists/jeremih/tracks/late-nights-jeftuz-remix/","slug":"late-nights-jeftuz-remix","title":"Late Nights (Jeftuz Remix)","artist":{"slug":"jeremih","title":"Jeremih"},"artwork":"images/artists/jeremih/tracks/late-nights-jeftuz-remix.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"vPfL7UzxY4Y","slug":"139","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-139-w-dj"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #139 w/ DJ Harrison","artwork":"/images/episodes/139.jpg","content":"DJ Harrison thows down a crazy live improvised session with the SP-404 and MPC1000\n\n<!--more-->\n\noe Kay started off with some nice deep/melodic tracks from Mr. Carmack, Christoph El Truento, Dirg Gerner, Iamnobodi, Sango, Last Night In Paris, Geode and many more! Joe took it back to the essence with Ginuwine/Timbaland/Dilla classics! DJ Harrison on the other hand who reminds us of Madlib (no really he does)all the way from Virginia threw down a crazy live session with the SP-404 & MPC 1000. Lots of soulful chops and intricate drum patterns! This is another amazing session from start to finish! Spread this if you feel it.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10810,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-03T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":3}},{"id":"Zui1uwON2S0","position":15,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jeremih - The End Feat. Chance The Rapper","track":{"id":"gISMbfMNby0","path":"/artists/jeremih/tracks/the-end-feat-chance-the-rapper/","slug":"the-end-ft-chance-the-rapper","title":"The End ft. Chance the Rapper","artist":{"slug":"jeremih","title":"Jeremih"},"artwork":"images/artists/jeremih/tracks/the-end-feat-chance-the-rapper.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"cvObvSAq4-U","slug":"183","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-183-w-sam-gellaitry"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #183 w/ Sam Gellaitry","artwork":"/images/episodes/183.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10750,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-08-16T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"bNye8s2kyx8","position":2,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jeremih - What I Like (Jeftuz Remix)","track":{"id":"5zRdCHjFVP4","path":"/artists/jeremih/tracks/what-i-like-jeftuz-remix/","slug":"what-i-like-jeftuz-remix","title":"What I Like (Jeftuz Remix)","artist":{"slug":"jeremih","title":"Jeremih"},"artwork":"images/artists/jeremih/tracks/what-i-like-jeftuz-remix.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"AHcAait4N7w","slug":"194","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-194"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #194","artwork":"/images/episodes/194.jpg","content":"Shouts to all the lovely people that I met and who came out to the shows in Australia especially The Operatives. I recorded this show in my hotel roo