soulection/sets/soulection-all-day-2023"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection All Day 2023","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-all-day-2023.jpeg","content":"\n**🎊🌟 Happy New Year 2023 🌟🎊**\n\nThe 5th year in a row Soulection Takesover Apple Music with of exclusive mixes from [Joe Kay](/episodes/all-day-2023/#joe-kays-set), [Jeftuz](/episodes/all-day-2023/#jeftuzs-set), [1981 Tokyo](/episodes/all-day-2023/#1981-tokyos-set), and [S!RENE](/episodes/all-day-2023/#srenes-set).\n\n<!--more-->\n\n#### Jump to:\n\n- [Joe Kay](/episodes/all-day-2023/#joe-kays-set)\n- [Jeftuz](/episodes/all-day-2023/#jeftuzs-set)\n- [1981 Tokyo](/episodes/all-day-2023/#1981-tokyos-set)\n- [S!RENE](/episodes/all-day-2023/#srenes-set)\n\nAlso listen to [Soulection All Day 2022](/episodes/all-day-2022/), [Soulection All Day 2021](/episodes/all-day-2021), [Soulection All Day 2020](/episodes/all-day-2020), and [Soulection All Day 2019](/episodes/all-day-2019).\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":28800,"location":"US","published_at":"2023-01-01T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"1981 Tokyo's Set","position":2}}],"albums":[],"linkedPlatforms":[]}